@startuml SQ-07
title SQ-07 Match completion & result persistence [P]
participant "Match Server" as MS
participant "All Clients" as C
participant "Backend API" as B
database MySQL as DB
MS -> MS : end condition met (last top / draw / timeout TBD / abort)
MS -> MS : build MatchResult {matchId, endReason, placements[],\neliminations[], launchSummaries[], durationMs, summaryEvents[]}
MS -> C : S2C_MatchEnded {placements, endReason} (provisional until persisted)
MS -> B : POST /internal/v1/matches/{matchId}/result\nAuthorization: service credential\nIdempotency-Key: matchId
B -> B : validate: instance owns matchId, participants match\nallocation, placements consistent
B -> DB : BEGIN; UPDATE game_match status=COMPLETED;\nUPDATE match_participant placements;\nINSERT match_event summaries;\nUPDATE competitive_record (rules TBD);\nUPDATE room status=OPEN|CLOSED [TBD OQ-GP-14]; COMMIT
alt first report
  B --> MS : 200 {persisted: true}
else duplicate (retry)
  B --> MS : 200 {persisted: true, duplicate: true}
else validation failure
  B --> MS : 422 RESULT_REJECTED + alert, match status=DISPUTED
end
B -> C : event match.completed {matchId}
note over MS : On 5xx/timeout: retry with backoff\nup to 24 h, results kept in local\njournal file (NFR-031)
MS -> MS : disconnect peers after 10 s;\nreset; state=IDLE; Heartbeat(IDLE)
@enduml
